  "prefLabel": "Lot 212.01 Role of Commission Staff in Enforcement or Disciplinary Hearings",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Lot 212.01 Role of Commission Staff in Enforcement or Disciplinary Hearings. Unless called as witnesses, commission staff shall have no role in any enforcement or disciplinary hearing.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Lot 200) #12093, eff 1-27-17 (See Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Lot 200)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/lot200.html"
